      "message": "I don\u0027t see config.h enforcing mutual exclusivity here, and pd_set_frs_enable() will run however many of the FRS functions are set up, as far as I can tell. \n\nI would say that this could be nice to have on a per-port basis of which chip to use, which I\u0027m guessing may be part of the purpose of this stack?",
